# Backend

Existing: Express 5, CommonJS, dotenv, nodemon. **No server file yet.** Add `index.js` (or the approved entry) without Nest, Fastify, or extra ORMs.

Business rules live in Express, not only in the client and not only in RLS.

## Do not implement without a signed requirement

- Leave balances / accruals
- Overtime, payroll, SSO, Teams/Slack
- Manager leave-approve API (manager approval is outside the app)
- Invented statuses such as “Unauthorized Absence”

## When implementing APIs

Treat `documentation/api/` as **Proposed**. Do not invent fields.

Suggested HTTP mapping from the pack (unsigned): 200 GET/PATCH, 201 create, 204 logout/delete, 401 unauthenticated, 403 forbidden, 404 unknown/foreign resource (TD), 409 overlap/duplicate/version, 422 validation, 429 rate limit.

Idempotency-Key on leave submit and punches is Proposed. Use transactions when leave approval also writes attendance and audit.

`guest_admin` must not mutate. Employees must not PATCH attendance days (BR-10). HR direct PATCH vs request-only is an unresolved conflict (ADR-0007) — do not silently pick one.
